{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeChipComponentTokensProvider\/borders","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B32ThemeChipComponentTokensProviderC7borders0A8Contract017AllBorderSemanticfG0_pvp","symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"borders"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract31AllBorderSemanticTokensProviderP"}],"title":"borders"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeChipComponentTokensProvider"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Provider of border semantic tokens to use for chip borders","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"borders","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract31AllBorderSemanticTokensProviderP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemechipcomponenttokensprovider\/borders"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeChipComponentTokensProvider/borders":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"borders","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract31AllBorderSemanticTokensProviderP"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Provider of border semantic tokens to use for chip borders","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeChipComponentTokensProvider\/borders","title":"borders","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemechipcomponenttokensprovider\/borders"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeChipComponentTokensProvider":{"title":"OrangeThemeChipComponentTokensProvider","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeChipComponentTokensProvider"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeChipComponentTokensProvider"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of chip"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"chip"}]},{"type":"text","text":" objects like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSFilterChip"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSuggestionChip"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllChipComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeChipComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ChipComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"chip"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Chip"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens of colors (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":") ,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spaces (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"), dimensions ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllDimensionSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and border  (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeChipComponentTokensProvider","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemechipcomponenttokensprovider","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/documentation/OUDSThemesContract/AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Something which provides all semantic tokens of border"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/allbordersemantictokensprovider","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider","title":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"title":"Theme Orange","role":"collection","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic "},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange","kind":"symbol"},"ic_theme_orange.png":{"alt":null,"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","type":"image","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]}}}